          "lines": [
            "The Jacquard Loom is a mechanical loom invented by Joseph Marie Jacquard in",
            "1801, which simplifies the process of manufacturing textiles with complex",
            "patterns. The loom is controlled by punched cards with punched holes, each row",
            "corresponding to one design row. Multiple rows of holes are punched on each",
            "card, and the many cards that compose the textile design are strung together in",
            "an orderly manner."
